{"duration":81.136125,"beats":[{"start":0.3,"end":9.741,"sentences":[{"start":0.3,"end":2.194,"text":"This is Minecraft. Except I built it.","words":[{"text":"This","start":0.3,"end":0.443},{"text":"is","start":0.493,"end":0.593},{"text":"Minecraft.","start":0.643,"end":1.243},{"text":"Except","start":1.318,"end":1.618},{"text":"I","start":1.643,"end":1.743},{"text":"built","start":1.793,"end":2.043},{"text":"it.","start":2.093,"end":2.154}]},{"start":2.414,"end":8.506,"text":"From scratch. No game engine. No Mojang. Just me and C plus plus, a language that hates me personally.","words":[{"text":"From","start":2.441,"end":2.591},{"text":"scratch.","start":2.666,"end":3.166},{"text":"No","start":3.241,"end":3.416},{"text":"game","start":3.466,"end":3.691},{"text":"engine.","start":3.741,"end":4.166},{"text":"No","start":4.266,"end":4.441},{"text":"Mojang.","start":4.516,"end":5.066},{"text":"Just","start":5.166,"end":5.391},{"text":"me","start":5.441,"end":5.591},{"text":"and","start":5.616,"end":5.691},{"text":"C","start":5.766,"end":5.941},{"text":"plus","start":5.991,"end":6.241},{"text":"plus,","start":6.316,"end":6.641},{"text":"a","start":6.716,"end":6.766},{"text":"language","start":6.816,"end":7.291},{"text":"that","start":7.341,"end":7.441},{"text":"hates","start":7.491,"end":7.766},{"text":"me","start":7.791,"end":7.891},{"text":"personally.","start":7.941,"end":8.466}]},{"start":8.726,"end":9.741,"text":"Here's how it started.","words":[{"text":"Here's","start":8.726,"end":8.919},{"text":"how","start":8.944,"end":9.044},{"text":"it","start":9.069,"end":9.119},{"text":"started.","start":9.169,"end":9.701}]}]},{"start":10.191,"end":34.433,"sentences":[{"start":10.191,"end":12.761,"text":"Day one. The goal: one cube, on the screen. That's it.","words":[{"text":"Day","start":10.191,"end":10.359},{"text":"one.","start":10.409,"end":10.584},{"text":"The","start":10.634,"end":10.684},{"text":"goal:","start":10.734,"end":10.934},{"text":"one","start":11.009,"end":11.184},{"text":"cube,","start":11.234,"end":11.434},{"text":"on","start":11.509,"end":11.584},{"text":"the","start":11.584,"end":11.634},{"text":"screen.","start":11.684,"end":12.109},{"text":"That's","start":12.209,"end":12.509},{"text":"it.","start":12.584,"end":12.721}]},{"start":12.981,"end":14.383,"text":"Sounds easy. It is not.","words":[{"text":"Sounds","start":13.018,"end":13.268},{"text":"easy.","start":13.318,"end":13.668},{"text":"It","start":13.768,"end":13.818},{"text":"is","start":13.868,"end":13.968},{"text":"not.","start":14.018,"end":14.343}]},{"start":14.603,"end":20.041,"text":"To draw anything, you have to talk to the graphics card. I picked a language for that called Vulkan.","words":[{"text":"To","start":14.643,"end":14.718},{"text":"draw","start":14.793,"end":15.068},{"text":"anything,","start":15.118,"end":15.593},{"text":"you","start":15.668,"end":15.743},{"text":"have","start":15.793,"end":15.968},{"text":"to","start":16.018,"end":16.093},{"text":"talk","start":16.168,"end":16.443},{"text":"to","start":16.493,"end":16.543},{"text":"the","start":16.568,"end":16.618},{"text":"graphics","start":16.668,"end":17.118},{"text":"card.","start":17.168,"end":17.668},{"text":"I","start":17.818,"end":17.918},{"text":"picked","start":17.993,"end":18.193},{"text":"a","start":18.218,"end":18.268},{"text":"language","start":18.318,"end":18.793},{"text":"for","start":18.843,"end":18.943},{"text":"that","start":18.993,"end":19.168},{"text":"called","start":19.218,"end":19.493},{"text":"Vulkan.","start":19.568,"end":20.001}]},{"start":20.261,"end":23.886,"text":"In Vulkan, just saying hello takes about a thousand lines of code.","words":[{"text":"In","start":20.279,"end":20.379},{"text":"Vulkan,","start":20.429,"end":20.854},{"text":"just","start":20.954,"end":21.104},{"text":"saying","start":21.154,"end":21.429},{"text":"hello","start":21.479,"end":21.854},{"text":"takes","start":21.904,"end":22.154},{"text":"about","start":22.179,"end":22.354},{"text":"a","start":22.379,"end":22.429},{"text":"thousand","start":22.529,"end":22.979},{"text":"lines","start":23.029,"end":23.304},{"text":"of","start":23.329,"end":23.404},{"text":"code.","start":23.479,"end":23.846}]},{"start":24.106,"end":27.707,"text":"So after a full day of yelling at my laptop: behold. A cube.","words":[{"text":"So","start":24.145,"end":24.295},{"text":"after","start":24.345,"end":24.57},{"text":"a","start":24.62,"end":24.67},{"text":"full","start":24.745,"end":24.92},{"text":"day","start":24.97,"end":25.145},{"text":"of","start":25.17,"end":25.22},{"text":"yelling","start":25.27,"end":25.545},{"text":"at","start":25.57,"end":25.62},{"text":"my","start":25.645,"end":25.795},{"text":"laptop:","start":25.845,"end":26.37},{"text":"behold.","start":26.47,"end":26.995},{"text":"A","start":27.145,"end":27.195},{"text":"cube.","start":27.27,"end":27.667}]},{"start":27.927,"end":32.612,"text":"It's red, it's green, it's checkered. It looks like a Rubik's cube that gave up on life.","words":[{"text":"It's","start":27.945,"end":28.095},{"text":"red,","start":28.17,"end":28.445},{"text":"it's","start":28.52,"end":28.67},{"text":"green,","start":28.745,"end":29.12},{"text":"it's","start":29.195,"end":29.345},{"text":"checkered.","start":29.395,"end":29.945},{"text":"It","start":30.095,"end":30.17},{"text":"looks","start":30.22,"end":30.395},{"text":"like","start":30.42,"end":30.57},{"text":"a","start":30.595,"end":30.645},{"text":"Rubik's","start":30.72,"end":31.07},{"text":"cube","start":31.12,"end":31.395},{"text":"that","start":31.445,"end":31.545},{"text":"gave","start":31.595,"end":31.795},{"text":"up","start":31.82,"end":31.945},{"text":"on","start":31.97,"end":32.12},{"text":"life.","start":32.17,"end":32.572}]},{"start":32.832,"end":34.433,"text":"I have never been prouder of anything.","words":[{"text":"I","start":32.85,"end":32.925},{"text":"have","start":32.95,"end":33.025},{"text":"never","start":33.075,"end":33.275},{"text":"been","start":33.3,"end":33.425},{"text":"prouder","start":33.475,"end":33.825},{"text":"of","start":33.875,"end":33.925},{"text":"anything.","start":33.975,"end":34.393}]}]},{"start":34.883,"end":47.878,"sentences":[{"start":34.883,"end":37.278,"text":"But Minecraft isn't one cube. It's millions.","words":[{"text":"But","start":34.883,"end":34.976},{"text":"Minecraft","start":35.026,"end":35.526},{"text":"isn't","start":35.551,"end":35.751},{"text":"one","start":35.801,"end":35.976},{"text":"cube.","start":36.026,"end":36.401},{"text":"It's","start":36.526,"end":36.676},{"text":"millions.","start":36.726,"end":37.238}]},{"start":37.498,"end":38.959,"text":"So I made a cube, out of cubes.","words":[{"text":"So","start":37.512,"end":37.612},{"text":"I","start":37.637,"end":37.687},{"text":"made","start":37.712,"end":37.837},{"text":"a","start":37.862,"end":37.887},{"text":"cube,","start":37.937,"end":38.212},{"text":"out","start":38.262,"end":38.362},{"text":"of","start":38.362,"end":38.412},{"text":"cubes.","start":38.462,"end":38.919}]},{"start":39.179,"end":45.505,"text":"Every block has six faces. But a face pressed against another block can never be seen, so I just don't draw it.","words":[{"text":"Every","start":39.197,"end":39.447},{"text":"block","start":39.497,"end":39.822},{"text":"has","start":39.872,"end":40.022},{"text":"six","start":40.097,"end":40.347},{"text":"faces.","start":40.397,"end":41.072},{"text":"But","start":41.172,"end":41.272},{"text":"a","start":41.297,"end":41.347},{"text":"face","start":41.447,"end":41.747},{"text":"pressed","start":41.822,"end":42.072},{"text":"against","start":42.122,"end":42.422},{"text":"another","start":42.447,"end":42.747},{"text":"block","start":42.797,"end":43.122},{"text":"can","start":43.172,"end":43.297},{"text":"never","start":43.347,"end":43.572},{"text":"be","start":43.622,"end":43.747},{"text":"seen,","start":43.847,"end":44.172},{"text":"so","start":44.247,"end":44.372},{"text":"I","start":44.422,"end":44.522},{"text":"just","start":44.572,"end":44.797},{"text":"don't","start":44.847,"end":44.997},{"text":"draw","start":45.047,"end":45.297},{"text":"it.","start":45.347,"end":45.465}]},{"start":45.725,"end":47.878,"text":"Free performance. The best kind of performance.","words":[{"text":"Free","start":45.752,"end":45.927},{"text":"performance.","start":45.977,"end":46.552},{"text":"The","start":46.627,"end":46.677},{"text":"best","start":46.727,"end":46.952},{"text":"kind","start":46.977,"end":47.127},{"text":"of","start":47.152,"end":47.202},{"text":"performance.","start":47.227,"end":47.838}]}]},{"start":48.328,"end":61.109,"sentences":[{"start":48.328,"end":53.536,"text":"Minecraft cuts its world into chunks. Mine are thirty-two blocks wide, tall and deep.","words":[{"text":"Minecraft","start":48.371,"end":48.996},{"text":"cuts","start":49.071,"end":49.296},{"text":"its","start":49.346,"end":49.496},{"text":"world","start":49.546,"end":49.821},{"text":"into","start":49.846,"end":50.021},{"text":"chunks.","start":50.096,"end":50.721},{"text":"Mine","start":50.871,"end":51.171},{"text":"are","start":51.221,"end":51.321},{"text":"thirty-two","start":51.396,"end":51.821},{"text":"blocks","start":51.871,"end":52.246},{"text":"wide,","start":52.321,"end":52.671},{"text":"tall","start":52.771,"end":53.071},{"text":"and","start":53.121,"end":53.196},{"text":"deep.","start":53.246,"end":53.496}]},{"start":53.756,"end":56.986,"text":"This one has three thousand, four hundred and fifteen faces.","words":[{"text":"This","start":53.756,"end":53.924},{"text":"one","start":53.924,"end":54.124},{"text":"has","start":54.174,"end":54.349},{"text":"three","start":54.424,"end":54.649},{"text":"thousand,","start":54.699,"end":55.224},{"text":"four","start":55.349,"end":55.549},{"text":"hundred","start":55.599,"end":55.899},{"text":"and","start":55.924,"end":55.999},{"text":"fifteen","start":56.049,"end":56.374},{"text":"faces.","start":56.424,"end":56.946}]},{"start":57.206,"end":61.109,"text":"Minecraft shows hundreds of these at once. Do the math. Actually, don't.","words":[{"text":"Minecraft","start":57.249,"end":57.799},{"text":"shows","start":57.849,"end":58.074},{"text":"hundreds","start":58.149,"end":58.549},{"text":"of","start":58.574,"end":58.624},{"text":"these","start":58.649,"end":58.824},{"text":"at","start":58.874,"end":58.999},{"text":"once.","start":58.999,"end":59.399},{"text":"Do","start":59.499,"end":59.599},{"text":"the","start":59.624,"end":59.674},{"text":"math.","start":59.724,"end":60.124},{"text":"Actually,","start":60.274,"end":60.699},{"text":"don't.","start":60.774,"end":61.069}]}]},{"start":61.559,"end":78.086,"sentences":[{"start":61.559,"end":66.46,"text":"So, a trick. If two faces next to each other look the same, glue them into one big face.","words":[{"text":"So,","start":61.622,"end":61.847},{"text":"a","start":61.897,"end":61.947},{"text":"trick.","start":62.022,"end":62.322},{"text":"If","start":62.422,"end":62.522},{"text":"two","start":62.597,"end":62.772},{"text":"faces","start":62.847,"end":63.247},{"text":"next","start":63.297,"end":63.522},{"text":"to","start":63.547,"end":63.597},{"text":"each","start":63.622,"end":63.772},{"text":"other","start":63.797,"end":63.997},{"text":"look","start":64.047,"end":64.197},{"text":"the","start":64.247,"end":64.322},{"text":"same,","start":64.397,"end":64.747},{"text":"glue","start":64.872,"end":65.047},{"text":"them","start":65.072,"end":65.222},{"text":"into","start":65.247,"end":65.447},{"text":"one","start":65.522,"end":65.722},{"text":"big","start":65.772,"end":65.947},{"text":"face.","start":66.022,"end":66.42}]},{"start":66.68,"end":70.813,"text":"Two hundred and seventy-five. Same chunk. Twelve times fewer faces.","words":[{"text":"Two","start":66.698,"end":66.898},{"text":"hundred","start":66.948,"end":67.323},{"text":"and","start":67.373,"end":67.448},{"text":"seventy-five.","start":67.523,"end":68.348},{"text":"Same","start":68.473,"end":68.723},{"text":"chunk.","start":68.773,"end":69.098},{"text":"Twelve","start":69.223,"end":69.498},{"text":"times","start":69.548,"end":69.873},{"text":"fewer","start":69.948,"end":70.173},{"text":"faces.","start":70.248,"end":70.773}]},{"start":71.033,"end":73.5,"text":"Is that cheating? Yes. Am I going to stop? No.","words":[{"text":"Is","start":71.051,"end":71.126},{"text":"that","start":71.176,"end":71.326},{"text":"cheating?","start":71.376,"end":71.801},{"text":"Yes.","start":71.926,"end":72.201},{"text":"Am","start":72.301,"end":72.376},{"text":"I","start":72.426,"end":72.501},{"text":"going","start":72.526,"end":72.676},{"text":"to","start":72.701,"end":72.751},{"text":"stop?","start":72.801,"end":73.126},{"text":"No.","start":73.201,"end":73.46}]},{"start":73.72,"end":78.086,"text":"Next time: making it actually look like Minecraft. Follow, or the cube gets it.","words":[{"text":"Next","start":73.763,"end":73.988},{"text":"time:","start":74.013,"end":74.288},{"text":"making","start":74.363,"end":74.613},{"text":"it","start":74.638,"end":74.713},{"text":"actually","start":74.788,"end":75.213},{"text":"look","start":75.263,"end":75.413},{"text":"like","start":75.438,"end":75.613},{"text":"Minecraft.","start":75.663,"end":76.413},{"text":"Follow,","start":76.563,"end":77.038},{"text":"or","start":77.138,"end":77.263},{"text":"the","start":77.288,"end":77.338},{"text":"cube","start":77.413,"end":77.663},{"text":"gets","start":77.713,"end":77.938},{"text":"it.","start":77.988,"end":78.046}]}]}]}